GW LAYOUT: SETTINGS + FEED RIGHT
================================
index.html structure:

1) Data Configuration (id=gw-intel-detail) and Alerts (id=gw-alerts-center)
   live INSIDE #gw-settings-modal (settings body grid). Not main-stage clutter.

2) Meldungsfeed (#gw-feed-panel) is the right column:
   class="gw-right-rail gw-feed-dock" inside .gw-body-triple
   Grid: left layers | center globe | right feed

3) CSS:
   .gw-body-triple → minmax(168-200) | 1fr | minmax(300-360)
   .gw-feed-dock full-height column list
   Removed freestanding .gw-feed-float overlay as primary layout

4) Personal Impact also under Settings for clarity.
